window.bookSummaryJSON = "<b>For fans of <i>One Dark Window </i>and <i>From Blood and Ash</i> comes a haunting, slow-burn romantasy debut following a once magicless elf as she inherits forbidden dark powers, forcing her into deadly trials against ruthless witches, a perilous alliance with a duplicitous prince, and unimaginable sacrifices to protect her realm from collapse.</b><br><br>After her grandmother’s execution, a formerly magicless elf is suddenly the most powerful witch in her village. Magic is disappearing though, and Imani is thrust into the treacherous court of her kingdom, forced into trials against the most lethal witches in the world.<br> <br>As she unravels the perilous plan her grandmother plotted before her death to save magic, Imani unwittingly uncovers a web of magical and political intrigue that puts her on a collision course with dangers beyond anything she’s imagined.<br> <br>But Imani is harboring illicit knowledge of her own—a forbidden dark magic that’s getting more and more difficult to hide by the day. Now, she must decide whether to make herself a threat and an enemy to her country or risk becoming a pawn as she watches the realm lose magic forever.<br> <br>Imani sees only one path forward: a dangerous deal with the duplicitous prince—one she might be falling for.<br> <br><i>The Elf Witch </i>is the first book in an epic romantasy series that is perfect for fans of Rachel Gillis, Jeneane O’Riley, and L.J. Andrews."; 
